IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROBE-COMPOUND.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-TOTAL    PIC 9(8)V99 VALUE 2500.01.
01  WS-ONE      PIC 9(7)V99.
01  WS-STEP     PIC 9(7)V99.
01  WS-FINAL    PIC 9(7)V99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    COMPUTE WS-ONE = 0.65 * WS-TOTAL / 52
    DISPLAY "compound " WS-ONE
    COMPUTE WS-STEP = WS-TOTAL / 52
    COMPUTE WS-FINAL = WS-STEP * 0.65
    DISPLAY "stepwise " WS-FINAL
    STOP RUN.
